option.SWAMP_FOG = Swamp fog
option.SWAMP_FOG.comment = Ground fog in swamps and mangrove swamps. Off by default since 25.08.2026 because it switches on and off abruptly at the biome border: the biome value is a single global number for the camera position and jumps in one frame when you cross. Fixing that needs a time-smoothed biome value, and there is currently no spare buffer channel for one. The fog itself works fine when you are well inside the biome. RAIN fog is unaffected and stays on - it runs off wetness, which Minecraft ramps over several seconds anyway.
option.COLD_FOG = Cold fog (volumetric)
option.COLD_FOG.comment = Dense fog in cold biomes. Marches along the view ray and therefore forms real fog banks instead of an even haze. Costs nothing in warm biomes.
