option.CLOUD_SHADOW_SOFT.comment = How long the transition from lit to shadowed ground is. The value is the exponent that turns cloud density into shadow strength. "Hard" matches the curve used for water reflections: a cloud of just one percent density already casts 22 percent of the full shadow, so the entire transition sits in a tiny range of density and becomes a hard edge on screen. Higher values stretch it out - thin cloud edges cast almost no shadow, while the core still casts the full one.
